{"xson":[{"/iati-activities/iati-activity":[{"/activity-date":[{"@iso-date":"2009-09-15","@type":"2"},{"@iso-date":"2017-01-17","@type":"4"}],"/activity-status@code":"4","/collaboration-type@code":"2","/contact-info":[{"/department/narrative":[{"1":"MCO-EGY","@xml:lang":"EN"}],"/email":[{"1":"t.al-eryani@ifad.org"}],"/job-title/narrative":[{"1":"Country Director","@xml:lang":"EN"}],"/organisation/narrative":[{"1":"International Fund for Agricultural Development","@xml:lang":"EN"}],"/person-name/narrative":[{"1":"Al-Eryani, Thoodan Abdulkarim Ali","@xml:lang":"EN"}],"/telephone":[{"1":"+390654591"}],"/website":[{"1":"http://www.ifad.org"}],"@type":"1"}],"/default-aid-type":[{"@code":"C01","@vocabulary":"1"}],"/default-tied-status@code":"5","/description":[{"/narrative":[{"1":"The overall goal of the project is to increase the production and income of small-scale gum producers in selected areas of the gum belt through improved performance of production and marketing systems. This will be achieved through (i) the implementation of the gum arabic sector reform, creating equal opportunity and competition among all market actors; and (ii) strengthening GAPA organization and capacity in order to improve their bargaining position.The policy objective of the project has largely been achieved as a result of the Government's  decision in June 2009 to decontrol gum arabic exports and abolish the Gum Arabic Company's exclusive concession for exporting raw gum. The project will support the enforcement of the reform by developing proposals for an alternative tax regime, providing incentive packages for processors and exporters, and improving the bargaining position of GAPAs and their unions.","@xml:lang":"EN"}]}],"/document-link":[{"/category":[{"@code":"A12"}],"/description/narrative":[{"1":"More information on how IFAD publish IATI data to ensure the effectiveness of development.","@xml:lang":"EN"}],"/language":[{"@code":"EN"}],"/title/narrative":[{"1":"IATI documentation on IFA